  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>About Calm Puffs</strong><br>Calm Puffs is a modern lifestyle brand creating flavorful, nicotine-free diffusers designed for people looking for a fresh alternative to traditional habits. Our collection combines distinctive flavors with ingredients such as Vitamin C, Vitamin B12, caffeine, melatonin and ashwagandha across a range of lifestyle-focused products.</p><p><strong>Why partner with us?</strong><br>We are actively growing our creator and affiliate community and are looking for authentic creators, influencers, publishers and content partners who can introduce Calm Puffs to relevant adult audiences.</p><p><strong>How affiliates earn</strong><br>Affiliates earn <strong>20% commission on every qualifying order</strong> generated through their unique affiliate link or coupon code. High-performing partners may qualify for increased commissions, bonuses, complimentary products and recurring paid collaborations.</p><p><strong>How to promote Calm Puffs</strong><br>We welcome authentic social media content, product-focused videos, reviews, lifestyle content, blogs, UGC and other approved promotional methods. We prefer natural content that fits your existing audience and content style.</p><p><strong>Creator opportunities</strong><br>Selected creators may also receive complimentary products and opportunities for paid TikTok, Instagram, YouTube and UGC partnerships.</p><p>Applications are reviewed manually to ensure a strong fit between our brand and each affiliate's audience.</p></div>",
